    "innovation": "This paper uses compositional dissimilarity modelling to project high-resolution, national-scale biodiversity futures for over 1200 plant, butterfly, and bird species across Great Britain, integrating the combined impacts of future climate and land-use scenarios to assess community reorganisation, novel bioclimates, and species extinction risk.",
